\textbf{Reasoning:}
Megan earned 8 points per bag. If she had recycled all 14 bags, she would have earned 14 * 8 = 112 points. However, she didn't recycle 5 bags, so she only recycled 14 - 5 = 9 bags. Therefore, she earned 9 * 8 = 72 points.

\boxed{72}

